                    <signifLet xml:id="m-83d67425-2f52-4a2d-9fb1-2ca8b2040f6e" /></nc></neume></syllable></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-6f83765a-3052-4835-8d6f-5ccc3e403521"><lg xml:id="m-48262adb-fe2b-4019-beef-685d249627e3"><l xml:id="m-d963d499-2655-493b-8396-6c754a69cf40" facs="#m-fc7e3024-a1fb-489e-966c-29310fd4460a" label="ambiguous">1es0</l><l xml:id="m-2e97d2d3-8f4d-4deb-bc9a-cbba0b3cddf0" facs="#m-1f3c4156-cb46-4d69-949c-0baeb991d000" label="ambiguous">September 23.</l><l xml:id="m-4a8dfafe-da16-42aa-9028-05e2ef83143f" facs="#m-58d6fd32-909d-414d-b394-14186155a977" label="lyrics-like">má-net in saécu-lum saécu-li.</l><l xml:id="m-9024bada-6e16-4bda-8d7f-77f2846021c1" facs="#m-025cd3e3-0bee-4a1e-9e77-2bce446d5f7e" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-b03c8f7c-cbb6-4904-b922-5c58b98e3ed0" facs="#m-97a750be-1dd3-4792-b12d-2041a982d74e" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 8. G. p. 212. — Prayer. Deus, qui beátum. as below.</l><l xml:id="m-bcec705a-1ede-46c6-a75e-77839edca2a5" facs="#m-df28baff-6471-45fe-90c0-41a75e774663" label="lyrics-like">At Ist Vespers. V. Amávit éum. At 2nd Vespers. V. Jústum dedúxit.</l><l xml:id="m-3aad75a3-a3d9-4bba-9f81-9f59b0b62aff" facs="#m-05e0b732-8fcc-4118-8038-33b04e609db2" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Státuit. p. 1182, except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-f829a79a-3c40-4b58-b3e4-4aab67aa98b3" facs="#m-5404f170-344a-441a-b721-c90a650a88c8" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-23056e77-9710-483e-9dad-fc5e7da2a40f" facs="#m-706c2c0c-69a3-44ba-a24c-fa51857d6774" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui beátum Thomam Pon-] omnes qui te deprecántur,* divitias</l><l xml:id="m-86394e44-7a6d-49d0-92eb-cc9f7e45c83e" facs="#m-9f2b861b-9f71-4ec9-a06a-2b7d689c895a" label="lyrics-like">1 tificem insignis in páuperes! misericórdiae tuae benígnus effún¬</l><l xml:id="m-d0b80ef5-892b-4135-8541-7908cd6127f2" facs="#m-48bc5b11-6a93-4007-a093-6e5b1de669c8" label="lyrics-like">misericórdiae virtúte decorásti: t] das. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-714be42f-33a0-44c8-8094-200359e7ebe5" facs="#m-5648657a-2914-43a7-8379-2d180d06d1aa" label="lyrics-like">quaésumus; ut ejus intercessióne, in</l><l xml:id="m-16404aa2-0945-4a8a-a35f-1ba04144a98e" facs="#m-1736e999-4d6d-43bb-9c0a-c2c7f5181354" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Sancti Thomae. Postcommunion. Deus, fidélium. p. 1188.</l><l xml:id="m-fa92c75f-97f6-416c-a211-d2202658e116" facs="#m-d9c61a7a-6f31-4342-b562-2b2d835906fc" label="text-like">Commemoration of St. Mauriee and his Companions, Martyrs.</l><l xml:id="m-11c2bc85-5a8c-43a9-9b8b-f214d32ef692" facs="#m-855593b4-1a53-4ee0-8113-8246fd8d028a" label="text-like">Mass. Intret. p. 1162.</l><l xml:id="m-24569bb0-b2c4-4de7-b80f-de8b7f78eae0" facs="#m-f4e658ab-f827-41e0-bc1c-0858a802b8db" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-3cac3a34-82bc-48c4-83e7-babc52eb2c18" facs="#m-3519a944-e90a-44ae-812d-bdbc229b8d4f" label="lyrics-like">INnue, quaésumus omnípotens nos laetíficet festíva solémnitas:</l><l xml:id="m-734c0cdc-7e01-4a71-80d6-635002ae0f11" facs="#m-089a4eb6-f8a3-4c17-94af-ec5ecc31f053" label="lyrics-like">II Deus: ut sanctórum Mártyrum ut quorum suffrágiis nítimur, eórum</l><l xml:id="m-18e3aace-ddac-4cef-900b-4e96c5996f29" facs="#m-e58a8fdf-d15c-4e97-96a9-d28c7f58e517" label="lyrics-like">tuórum Maurstii et Sociórum ejus natalitiis gloriémur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-b5697051-539b-4c1f-aaec-2ab59989ca17" facs="#m-7effe1a5-742a-48e9-a1f7-983127719ede" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-00f11e9a-0695-4bc8-b124-7d654042edce" facs="#m-98bbcc6c-660b-449f-a447-c0aeeb2b2835" label="lyrics-like">D Espice, quaésumus Dómine, mú¬t praesta; ut quorum honóre sunt</l><l xml:id="m-36bf3b6e-e9af-411e-a0c7-ead94e9c9ae6" facs="#m-b352e8ae-da60-43b1-ac7f-33e70cc1994f" label="lyrics-like">grãta, eórum nobis fiant interces¬</l><l xml:id="m-6c71a990-f2ef-43e0-b349-a0dbe5b03dec" facs="#m-4deb3db8-96e9-446f-9733-0a44bf83b436" label="lyrics-like">It nera, quae in sanctórum Már¬</l><l xml:id="m-60917e82-68f9-42de-b43c-3d75e6a3387d" facs="#m-91bc7400-d3d0-4c33-82bb-f9be9e700145" label="lyrics-like">tyrum tuórum Mauritii et Sociórum</l><l xml:id="m-ea829206-abd7-4065-a55a-ce59efd74052" facs="#m-027a05a7-1b85-49a0-a0e2-eb57f9840a3b" label="lyrics-like">sióne perpétua. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-dbba0b42-107c-4aa4-a247-f2e47eacabb0" facs="#m-63f81599-1a25-4261-aa78-7d70764dd4fa" label="lyrics-like">ejus commemoratióne deférimus:</l><l xml:id="m-be1a97f0-8546-42f8-8aaa-e622b617a276" facs="#m-a425fc81-fe4a-4d86-aae2-08e2831aeef6" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-e734cde7-e39a-40a2-a753-82ac6ea3ef72" facs="#m-9ae990bf-c501-4ad2-abde-df6dc712ba2b" label="lyrics-like">vAeléstibus refécti sacraméntis et ! triúmphis, protegámur auxiliis. Per</l><l xml:id="m-b3a2ae66-bd11-416e-b6b4-7b069db2d468" facs="#m-40e7c531-5aac-4721-a098-075c04854cbf" label="lyrics-like">Lgáudiis, súpplices te rogámus</l><l xml:id="m-48879833-1f4b-4d7b-8e0c-f57e4149a5ea" facs="#m-74f7695e-b235-4ea3-a12d-613fa3132064" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-3a9f13b7-791e-475d-835e-5da612cd9389" facs="#m-fffbbd3a-af74-4ee8-b74b-d42d8b3cd56d" label="lyrics-like">Dómine; ut quorum gloriámur</l><l xml:id="m-1b0e0ccb-e2eb-4689-8c26-653607a43e70" facs="#m-f47f4bfd-2426-4bff-954f-1bd104d1d83e" label="text-like">St. Linus, Pope and Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-e4406f67-5c9b-4630-8581-f86cd6d20f04" facs="#m-fad645df-0bdf-4ecd-8fab-8c76b321c5ba" label="ambiguous">23.</l><l xml:id="m-c2be4d1a-a940-44db-b2b5-6b74a86ae0cc" facs="#m-72e11605-97e1-471c-a94f-5cd0a8eab16c" label="ambiguous">Semi-double.</l><l xml:id="m-5df05c17-ff20-483b-9cdf-81642e5e2aed" facs="#m-dffdea36-3850-4329-a9e6-2ad6986a2d7e" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-24881941-0e38-4c58-99f5-9779b3c12b70" facs="#m-9653d9ae-d269-478b-9941-7ac7033354b2" label="lyrics-like">(Regem tuum, Pastor aetérne, l tua protectióne custódi; * quem</l><l xml:id="m-69a718f6-b9b7-4861-81cc-0d485317532a" facs="#m-99dae782-21db-47ef-96cc-8d722ff65190" label="lyrics-like">( placátus inténde: t et per</l><l xml:id="m-236c536e-07e6-4605-ab02-7ad414e3cd0c" facs="#m-2ee46d6c-4897-4076-b665-11a768616073" label="lyrics-like">totíus Ecclésiae praestitísti esse pa¬</l><l xml:id="m-e23e6174-2078-45a2-8fa7-89fd606f68f6" facs="#m-bec36ab8-5624-4df4-8df8-04be44d50861" label="lyrics-like">beátum Linum Mártyrem tuum stórem. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-bc156ca3-2bdf-44ea-9b2a-26309bfa69ea" facs="#m-c0a5631c-c5b6-4394-9aea-8448dfc1b5b1" label="lyrics-like">atque Summum Pontíficem, perpé¬</l><l xml:id="m-43dc816c-b6ca-40ae-afeb-f3caf7c8bf68" facs="#m-aa1a76d4-0b43-426c-9a57-e25bcd6349c9" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Oblátio. p. 1122e, and Postcommunion. Refectióne. p. 1123.</l><l xml:id="m-168a9956-a02c-4f3d-9009-f0652473d6fa" facs="#m-a15aab6a-4333-4d2d-a517-1e626776f09c" label="text-like">Commemoration of Saint Thecla, Virgin and Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-0265b927-58f3-43ff-9efe-fef30e5666b7" facs="#m-7ff50099-f73e-4e51-80e3-e5ce1795aa49" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-975ce2e5-7818-4140-9ecc-768ea8e5240f" facs="#m-369dab4d-49ae-4e66-ac6a-851c0f8e4d3f" label="lyrics-like">A, quaésumus omnipotens! cólimus, et ánnua solemnitá̂te lae¬</l><l xml:id="m-0d015e03-a874-42ed-b8e9-e3d9fba3120e" facs="#m-f908b563-dcf9-486a-8a0a-6c1d134ae34f" label="lyrics-like">1 Deus:*ut qui beátae Theclae témur, et tantae fidei proficiámus</l><l xml:id="m-396b8bee-9289-440e-99d6-b43418e97879" facs="#m-70e95355-90f5-401f-92af-9eca2d2f1c92" label="lyrics-like">Virginis et Mártyris tuae natalstia l exémplo. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9588ee68-cfbd-47d0-b7e8-459e6c4a7fcd" facs="#m-b5a2b5a1-676f-40f3-bfcb-aa59a9b2a0c6" label="lyrics-like">secret. Súscipe Dómine, and Postcommunion. Auxiliéntur nobis. p. 1220.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
